WebCockpit map assets (ADR 0020)
================================

Files in this directory are fetched by the map worker only when the Map
pane is switched on. They are not part of the app's cold start.

arda.mm2
--------
The owner's MMapper map (MMapper schema v42), bundled as the default map
by owner decision (ADR 0020, 2026-09-28). It contains MUME's room names
and descriptions. Those texts belong to MUME (https://mume.org) and carry
no licence. The owner decided to keep the file in the public repository
(2026-09-28), on the same terms as MMapper, which distributes a MUME map
with its releases. The file is read as is and never changed.

pixmaps/
--------
The default tileset of MMapper 26.06.0, copied unmodified from
src/resources/pixmaps/ of the release source tree.

  MMapper: https://github.com/MUME/MMapper
  Copyright (C) The MMapper Authors
  Licence: GNU General Public License, version 2 or (at your option) any
  later version (GPL-2.0-or-later). WebCockpit is distributed under
  the same licence (ADR 0027).

fonts/Cantarell{18,27,36}.fnt, fonts/Cantarell{18,27,36}_0.png
--------------------------------------------------------------
Bitmap (BMFont) renderings of the Cantarell typeface at 18, 27 and 36 px,
copied unmodified from src/resources/fonts/ of MMapper 26.06.0, which
draws all map text with them.

  Cantarell: https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/cantarell-fonts
  Copyright (c) 2009--2019, The Cantarell Authors
  Licence: SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1 (fonts/OFL.txt). Cantarell
  declares no Reserved Font Name.

MMapper's own fonts/LICENSE covers only DejaVu Sans Mono and does not
mention Cantarell. The licence above is the upstream Cantarell licence
(verified against the cantarell-fonts package's COPYING, 2026-09-28;
fonts/OFL.txt is that file).
